      "text": "// Cypher — многошаговый запрос агента для судебных дел в Neo4j\nMATCH (p:Party {name: 'Party A'})-[:SIGNED]->(c:Contract)\n      -[:GOVERNED_BY]->(cl:Clause {id: 7})\nRETURN p, c, cl,\n       [n IN nodes(path) | n.source_doc] AS provenance_trail",
